[9987]="7000E8FD\n1\tCollect Thistlebelly Brew from the Ivy Bush in Hobbiton\tThistlebelly Brew can be purchased from The Ivy Bush in Hobbiton. You should get some Thistlebelly Brew to deliver to Wald Mugwort.\n2\tBring Thistlebelly Brew to Wald Mugwort\tThe Ivy Bush is in the village of Hobbiton in the Shire, far to the west of the Lone-lands. Wald Mugwort is at Ost Haer in the Lone-lands, far to the east of the Shire. Wald Mugwort, a Hobbit from Hobbiton, feels he needs a bit of a taste of home if he is to continue on his quest to complete the Inn League's Challenge. He has asked you to bring him a bit of \"Thistlebelly's Brew\" from the Ivy Bush in Hobbiton.\n",
[9988]="700216E5\n1\tCollect fake Thistlebelly Brew\tThe tavern keep is in the cellar of Thorin's Hall. You should collect a small beer from Thorin's Hall's inn, and then deliver it to Wald Mugwort under the guise of Thistlebelly Brew.\n2\tBring the fake Thistlebelly Brew to Wald Mugwort\tWald Mugwort is at Ost Haer in the Lone-lands. You should bring the fake Thistlebelly Brew to Wald Mugwort. You will trick him with this, for it is actually a small beer from Thorin's Hall.\n",
