[9997]="7005990D\n1\tTalk to Yrjänä in the Great Lodge of Sûri-kylä\tThe Lossoth chieftain Yrjänä can be found in the Great Lodge of Sûri-kylä. You should ask Yrjänä if the Lossoth would be willing to trade for the key of Agoroth.\n2\tAgree to Yrjänä's terms\tYrjänä has asked you to promise to find a way to destroy the Oath-stone in exchange for the key of Agoroth. If you accept these terms, let Yrjänä know that you agree.\n3\tTalk to Yrjänä\tYou have agreed to destroy the Oath-stone in exchange for the key of Agoroth. You should talk to Yrjänä in Sûri-kylä.\n4\tTalk to Salavahti\tSalavahti can be found on the rise above Sûri-kylä. You should talk to Salavahti.\n5\tTalk to Lothrandir outside Sûri-kylä\tSalavahti has informed you that Lothrandir has returned to Sûri-kylä to meet you. You should talk to Lothrandir.\n6\tComplete 'Instance: The Power of Oaths'\tLothrandir and Arvedui are outside Sûri-kylä. You should listen to their conversation in 'Instance: The Power of Oaths.'\n7\tTalk to Lothrandir in Jä-reitti\tArvedui has shown you and Lothrandir the hidden entrance to Agoroth in Jä-reitti. You should talk to Lothrandir.\n",
[9998]="70043280\n1\tTalk to Roamingstar, Maiden of Gilrain\tRoamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Roamingstar has rallied her Sisters and is now prepared to confront the Lone Lady. You should speak to her when you are ready.\n2\tDeliver Castamir's armour to Angbor near the Crossings of Erui\tAngbor can be found on a hill to the west of the Crossings of Erui. You have aided Roamingstar and her Sisters in calming the Lone Lady's rage, and have also recovered pieces of Castamir's armour. You should bring the armour to Angbor near the Crossings of Erui.\n3\tTalk to Lady Terenis in Tumladen\tLady Terenis can be found in the Great Hall of Tumladen. You have delivered Castamir's armour to Angbor, and should now speak to Lady Terenis.\n",
