[10016]="7005B114\n1\tDefeat Orcs and goblins at Rung-shakam (total: 14)\030Defeat trolls at Rung-shakam (total: 6)\030Destroy Orkish drums at Rung-shakam (total: 6)\tOrcs, goblins, trolls, and Orkish drums can be found at Rung-shakam. King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Rung-shakam. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.\n2\tRaise a banner of the Haban’akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam\tYou have done much to hinder the Orcs and their vile allies at Rung-shakam. You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam.\n",
